      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natalia%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits on the historic Missouri Pacific Railroad line and Interstate 35, linking it directly to San Antonio.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
