      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natalia%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Founded by the Medina Irrigation Company, Natalia grew around the irrigation projects that transformed the desert into farmland.",
